in modal\nOpen media 3 in modal\nOpen media 4 in modal\nOpen media 5 in modal\nOpen media 6 in modal\n1\n/\nof\n6\nLitepower 650W\nLitepower 650W\nSKU:PS-LTP-0650NPCNxx-2\nNon-modular PSU with 120mm cooling fan.\nView full details\nDesign\nSpecification\nDownload\nHow-to Videos\nThe Litepower 650W  The Litepower 650W power supply supports ATX 12V V2.3 and EPS 12V standards, making it suitable for even the most demanding builds. Its embedded 120mm cooling fan ensures excellent airflow with minimal noise. Additionally, the single +12V rail design provides stable and reliable performance, enabling non-stop usage.  Ultra Quiet 120mm Fan Litepower Series adopts 120mm cooling fan delivers excellent airflow at an exceptionally low noise level.  Multiple Connectors The cables used for the Litepower 650W are black and low-profile, users are able to properly route the cables in optimal location to prevent airflow blockage. Connector TypeConnector QuantityCable QuantityCable LengthMain Power(20+4Pin) X 1 X 1450mm ATX 12V(4+4Pin) X 1 X 1550mm PCIe  (6+2Pin) X 2 X 1450mm+150mm SATA (4Pin) X 4 X 2 450mm+150mm +150mm Peripheral(4Pin)X 2 High-Quality Components High quality components enable non-stop usage with stable and reliable performance, no more capacitor explosion and leakage.  High amperage Single +12V Rail The Litepower 650W is equipped with powerful +12V rails, superior performance under all types of system loading. AC INPUTInput Voltage: 230V  Input Current: 9A Frequency: 50Hz-60Hz DC OUTPUT+3.3V+5V+12V-12V+5VSBMax Output Current23A17A48A 0.5A2.5AMax Output Power110W576W 6W 12.5W Total Power650W Built-in Industrial Grade Protection To protect the hardware, the Litepower 650W is built with industry grade protections: OVP (Over Voltage Protection), OPP(Over Power Protection), SCP(Short Circuit Protection). OVP Over Voltage Protection OPPOver Power Protection SCP Short Circuit Protection\nProduct Specifications\nP/N\nPS-LTP-0650NPCNxx-2\nModel\nLTP-650AL2NK\nDimensions\n150mm(W)x86mm(H)x140mm(D)\nPFC (Power Factor Correction)\nActive PFC\nPower Good Signal\n100-500 msec\nHold Up Time\n> 16msec\nInput Current\n9A\nInput Frequency Range\n50Hz-60Hz\nInput Voltage\n230V\nOperating Temperture\n+5℃ to +35℃\nOperating Humidity\n20% to 85%,non-condensing\nStorage Temperture\n-40°C to + 55°C\nStorage Humidity\n10% to 95%, non-condensing\nCooling System\n120mm Fan: 2000±10% RPM\nEfficiency\nMeet 80 PLUS® Gold at 115Vac input.\nMTBF\n100,000 hrs minimum\nSafety Approval\nCE/TUV SUD/CB/EAC/RCM\nPCI-E 6+2PIN\n2\nProtection\nOVP/OPP/SCP\nUser Manual\nFile Name\nDescription\nSize\nVersion\nRelease Date\nLITEPOWER 650W Manual\n2024-08-07\nDrivers & Software\nFile Name\nDescription\nSize\nVersion\nRelease Date\nContact Us\nGeneral Information\nSales Partner Request\nLAN Party Request\nMedia Contact\nSupport\nWarranty Policy\nHow to find S/N\neRMA Service\nTechnical Support\nSoftware Downloads\nCommunity\nJoin TT Mod\nCaseMOD Invitation\nForums\nMarketing Materials\nCompany\nAbout Us\nWhere to Buy\nPrivacy Policy\nPress Release\nCollaboration\nThe Tower 300 Wilier Edition\nTT x Wilier\nTR100 Koralie Edition\nLCGS Store\nFlagship Store\nSystem Lecture\nSystem Workshop\nVideos\nTT Camp\nLocation\nGlobal\nAustralia\nBrazil\nChina\nGermany\nJapan\nKorea\nLatam\nPoland\nRussia\nSpain\nTaiwan\nThailand\nTurkey\nUK\nUSA\nSubscribe to our emails\nEmail\nFacebook\nInstagram\nYouTube\nTwitter\nTwitch\nReddit\nCopyright © 2026 Thermaltake Technology Co., Ltd. All Rights Reserved.\nChoosing a selection results in a full page refresh.\nOpens in a new window.",
